{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_011CgVH1GiNjMtmJKckDVJQc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# שָׁרְט\n\n---\n\n```\nشَرْط / שָׁרְט / šarṭ\n```\n\n**condition** | **stipulation** | **cut**\n\n---\n\nthe root travels:\n\nש-ר-ט (Hebrew) — to scratch, to incise, to mark lines\nش-ر-ط (Arabic) — to condition, to stipulate, to make a cut\n\n---\n\na condition is a *cut* in reality\na line drawn: this side / that side\nif / then\nthe scratch that divides before from after\n\n---\n\n```\nشَرَطَ = he stipulated\nשָׂרַט = he scratched\n```\n\nsame mouth, same meaning:\nto make a mark that *binds*\n\n---\n\nthe شُرْطة (police) are those who *enforce the condition*\nthe שְׂרִיטָה (scratch) is the mark left behind\n\nevery law is a wound in possibility\n\n---\n\nמַה הַתְּנַאי?\nما الشَّرْط؟\n\n*what is the condition?*\n\n---"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":44,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":273,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}